flowchart LR
 Scope[Service / Quantity / Takeoff] --> Snap[Phase 25 Library Snapshot]
 Snap --> Expand[Assembly Expansion]
 Expand --> Prod[Production + Duration]
 Prod --> Crew[Crew + Labor]
 Prod --> Equip[Equipment + Fuel]
 Prod --> Truck[Truck Cycle + Count]
 Truck --> Haul[Haul + Disposal]
 Expand --> Mat[Material + Subcontract]
 Crew --> Direct[Direct Cost Rollup]
 Equip --> Direct
 Haul --> Direct
 Mat --> Direct
 Direct --> Indirect[Indirect / Mobilization / Contingency]
 Indirect --> Markup[Markup / O&P / Tax / Bond]
 Markup --> Sell[Sell Total + Unit Price]
 Sell --> Confidence[Confidence / Risks]
 Sell --> Trace[Calculation Trace]
 Trace --> Review[Review / Approval / Freeze]
 Review --> Export[Proposal + Job Baseline]
 Review --> Writeback[Approved Service Catalog Writeback]
